    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "The left hand counts the same way",
      "body": "Your left hand is a mirror of your right. Its thumb is still 1 and its little finger is still 5.\n\nSo on the left hand, finger 1 sits on the right side of the hand and finger 5 on the far left. Counting 1 to 5 on the left hand walks **down** the keyboard.\n\nPress **Watch** to see it.",
      "hands": [
